      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a short intro for a museum exhibit i'm working on? it's called \"The Evolving Face of Our Nation\" and it's basically about how immigration has shaped our identity over the years. just needs to be a few sentences to get people interested in the displays. thanks!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
