      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a couple of options for your introduction, depending on the tone you prefer.\n\n**Option 1 (Inspirational Focus):**\n\"America is a constantly evolving narrative, and the story of our nation is deeply interwoven with the journeys of those who have come here. 'The Evolving Face of Our Nation' explores how the powerful act of immigration has shaped the very fabric of American identity for generations. Come explore the rich, global tapestry that makes up the American story today.\"\n\n**Option 2 (More Direct and Thematic Focus):**\n\"What truly defines the American experience is the movement of people, the constant becoming of a national identity through global influence. This exhibit, 'The Evolving Face of Our Nation,' unearths the diverse threads of immigration that have defined our culture, politics, and life. Discover how the world has come to America, and in the process, how America has been changed in return.\"",
