      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You can certainly balance this by framing the discussion around \"synthesis\" rather than \"conflict in the first sentence of the intro.\n\nTry a sentence like, \"This exhibit also thoughtfully examines the enduring dialogue between the desire for new futures and the deep commitment to the values and history that first defined this land, a powerful and essential national conversation in itself.\"\n\nThis approach acknowledges the need to preserve strong values without suggesting that the very * act of change or the act of belonging to a specific culture is inherently negative to the whole exhibit.",
